menu "ESP Pocket Audio Board"

config AUDIO_BOARD_ESP_POCKET_AUDIO
    bool "Use esp-pocket-audio board implementation"
    depends on AUDIO_BOARD_CUSTOM
    default y
    help
        Use the custom esp-pocket-audio board component. It keeps the
        ESP32-A1S/ES8388 audio wiring from the AI Thinker board and adds a
        separate I2C input bus for ADS1115 analog inputs and PCF8574 switch
        expanders.

endmenu
